# tags

Your own tags, which mark tasks with additional context (for example, the tasks an epic was split
into). One per line: `- <tag> <meaning>`.

# commands

Your own commands, run by typing them. One entry per command, entries separated by a blank line:

```
- `tf <name> <args>`

  D : <what the agent does; <args> are filled in from what you typed>
```

Names start with `tf ` and can't reuse a built-in command; those are listed in `.tf/skill/base.md`.
